<title>UK: Credit Suisse sets warrants on CS Holding.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse sets warrants on CS Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse, Zurich said it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, on CS Holding registered shares.</p>
<p>Five warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    135 CHF		   PREMIUM	7.50 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.25 CHF		  GEARING	12.08 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 13.DEC.96-03.SWP.97   PAYDATE	12.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT FIVE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  136 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
